        '<aside class="note-comm-ethiopian"><strong>Jubilees (Ethiopian tradition)</strong> <em>Book of Jubilees (Mäṣḥafä Kufāle)</em> <small>(c. 150 BC)</small><p>&#x27;And we explained to Noah all the medicines of their diseases, together with their seductions, how he might heal them with herbs of the earth.&#x27; The angels TEACH Noah a complete medical book — herbal remedies paired with demonological diagnoses. **Tewahedo medical-tradition anchor**: the Tewahedo traditional medical tradition (mädḫanit / herbal remedy plus the dǝbtära&#x27;s prayer-and-ritual practice) reads Jubilees 10:11 as canonical warrant — physical herbs + spiritual diagnosis is the divinely-revealed mode of healing, originally taught to Noah by the angels.</p></aside>',
